/* The UI fonts, built into winhttp.dll rather than shipped beside it. The
   launcher installs only the files it names and refuses an archive carrying
   anything else, and a resource travels with the loader through every set-up,
   move and removal. Read by HTiLoadFonts in gui.cpp.

   Language-neutral, so which variant FindResourceW picks cannot depend on the
   player's Windows display language. Paths are from the repo root (windres
   -I. in the Makefile). */
LANGUAGE 0, 0
FONT_DEJAVUSANS        RCDATA "fonts/DejaVuSans.ttf"
FONT_DROIDSANSFALLBACK RCDATA "fonts/DroidSansFallback.ttf"
